{"municipality_code":"22103","pref":"静岡県","city":"静岡市清水区","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"静岡市清水区には、江戸期の小島藩と小島藩陣屋跡に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚にまつわる場所が点在し、「蒲原城跡」、「江尻城跡」、「桑原遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 さらに小島藩にゆかりのある領主碑や旧領境のしるべも、現地で探してみたい歴史の手がかりです。 人物に目を向けるなら、武将・武士の徳川家康との縁をたどることで、街の歴史をより立体的に楽しめます。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":1185,"rank":81,"percentile":95.8,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":162,"rank":101,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":79,"rank":213,"percentile":88.5,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":51,"rank":28,"percentile":98.5,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":1,"rank":49,"percentile":96.3,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":14,"rank":330,"percentile":81.3,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":11,"rank":416,"percentile":75.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":7,"rank":40,"percentile":97.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":100,"rank":135,"percentile":92.7,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["徳川家康","森まさあき","今井義典"],"tou